CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/j/as com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/network/OutputNetStream
	COMMENT OutputNetStream - the writer matching InputNetStream: byteStream (ByteArrayOutputStream), rootStream (DataOutputStream), currentStream (the stream written to - swapped inside named blocks), blockStack (LinkedList of PacketOutputStream), version (int, default 999999, set by the (int) constructor and read by g()). a(String,boolean)/a(String) open/close a named block (the block is written as name + length + payload); e() writes the 12345 "mark" InputNetStream.a(String) verifies; a(int,int)/b(int) produce a Packet; a(Unit)/a(OrderableUnit) write -1 for null/removed/dead objects. [field names verified from code]
	FIELD a currentStream Ljava/io/DataOutputStream;
	FIELD b byteStream Ljava/io/ByteArrayOutputStream;
	FIELD c rootStream Ljava/io/DataOutputStream;
	FIELD d version I
	FIELD e blockStack Ljava/util/LinkedList;
	METHOD a writeDouble (D)V
	METHOD a writeFloat (F)V
	METHOD a writeInt (I)V
	METHOD a writeLong (J)V
	METHOD a writeTeamId (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/n;)V
	METHOD a writeBoolean (Z)V
	METHOD c writeByte (I)V
	METHOD c writeUTF (Ljava/lang/String;)V
